ion(Ut.msg({defaultMessage:"Crash and performance reports to Anthropic.",id:"EGOuVJosgc"})),long:vt.longDescription(`"Essential" means the signals Anthropic needs to keep your deployment working: **crash stacks**, **startup failure reasons**, and **version/OS metadata**. No prompts, completions, file contents, or identifiers beyond a random install ID.

