**Why this is discouraged, not blocked:** some air-gapped environments require zero outbound telemetry as a matter of policy. The switch exists for them. If you don't have that constraint, leave it off.`,{docsUrl:`${sp.COWORK_3P_DOCS_BASE}/telemetry#essential-telemetry`})},predicates:{warn:(e)=>e===!0?Ut.msg({defaultMessage:"Crash and error reports are how we diagnose failures specific to your inference setup. Support turnaround will be slower without them.",id:"ek/rdG0G9V"}):null}}),disableNonessential:vt.field(jr.z.boolean().optional(),{flatKey:"disableNonessentialTelemetry",support:{enabled:{scopes:["3p"],availableInVersion:"1.2581.0"}},remotePolicy:{default:!0,applyUnverified:!0},failClosedValue:!0,title:Ut.msg({defaultMessage:"Block nonessential telemetry",id:"oo4Av05fBn"}),default:!1,category:"telemetry",group:co.ANTHROPIC_TELEMETRY_GROUP,order:1,description:{short:vt.shortDescription(Ut.msg({defaultMessage:"Product-usage analytics and diagnostic-report uploads. No message content.",id:"0X/lTj2Hvv"})),long:vt.longDescription(`"Nonessential" covers two things: **product-usage analytics** (which features get used, navigation patterns; no prompts or completions) and the **Send** action in Help \u2192 Generate Diagnostic Report. Turning this on stops both.

